						        <td colspan="2">
						            <p class="auto-style1"><br />
						            <font color="#000000" face="Arial" size="2">&emsp;Dear $Name,<br />
						            <br />
						            &emsp;Your Domain password at $CustomerName will expire in $daystoexpire days. Please change it as soon as possible.<br />
						            <br />
                                    &emsp;If you work remotely, you need to be sure to change your password before the last day.  Once your password has expired, you will no longer be able to connect to the VPN and will need to contact IT support or come into the office to change it.<br />
						            <br />
						            &emsp;To change your password, follow the method below:<br />
						            <br />
						            <br />
                                    &emsp;1. On your Windows computer<br />
                                    &emsp;&emsp;a. Log onto your computer as usual and make sure you are connected to the internet.<br />
                                    &emsp;&emsp;b. If you are not in the office, connect to the VPN. <br />
                                    &emsp;&emsp;c. Press Ctrl-Alt-Del and click on &quot;Change Password&quot;.<br />
                                    &emsp;&emsp;d. Fill in your old password and set a new password. See the password requirements below.<br />
                                    &emsp;&emsp;e. Press OK to return to your desktop. <br />
                                    &emsp;2. Update the passwords in your email client on your phone and you may need to update Outlook as well.<br />
                                    <br />
                                    &emsp;Your new password should NOT be the same as your previous one with just one character changed. <br />
                                    &emsp;The new password must meet the minimum requirements set forth in our corporate policies including:<br />
                                    &emsp;1. It must be at least $pwdchar characters long.<br />
                                    &emsp;2. It cannot match any of your past $pastPwd passwords.<br />
                                    &emsp;3. It cannot contain characters which match 3 or more consecutive characters of your username.<br />
                                    &emsp;4. You cannot change your password more often than once in a 24 hour period.<br />
]]>
